***REMOVED*** Authentication API Configuration
***REMOVED*** Copy this file to .env and customize for your environment

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** ENVIRONMENT AND RUNTIME
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ENVIRONMENT=development
DEBUG=false
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
LOGS_DIR=logs

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** SERVER CONFIGURATION
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
HOST=0.0.0.0
AUTH_API_PORT=8003

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** DATABASE CONFIGURATION
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/next_watch

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** CORS CONFIGURATION
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:8001,http://localhost:8002

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** JWT AUTHENTICATION SETTINGS
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** CRITICAL: These must match across all services in the platform
JWT_SECRET=change_this_in_production_very_important
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=30
REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRE_DAYS=7

***REMOVED*** Advanced JWT Configuration (Optional)
***REMOVED*** JWT_JWK={"kty":"oct","k":"your-jwk-key-here"}
JWT_JWK_ROTATION_INTERVAL=86400

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** SECURITY SETTINGS
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ALLOWED_HOSTS=localhost,127.0.0.1,auth-api

***REMOVED*** Password Hashing Configuration
PASSWORD_HASH_ROUNDS=12

***REMOVED*** Login Security
MAX_LOGIN_ATTEMPTS=5
LOGIN_LOCKOUT_DURATION_MINUTES=15
SESSION_TIMEOUT_MINUTES=60

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** PERFORMANCE MONITORING
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ENABLE_PERFORMANCE_METRICS=false

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** RATE LIMITING
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RATE_LIMIT_REQUESTS_PER_MINUTE=60
RATE_LIMIT_BURST=10

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** EMAIL CONFIGURATION (Optional - for password reset, verification)
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
***REMOVED*** SMTP_PORT=587
***REMOVED*** SMTP_USERNAME=your-email@gmail.com
***REMOVED*** SMTP_PASSWORD=your-app-password
***REMOVED*** FROM_EMAIL=noreply@nextwatch.com

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** DEVELOPMENT OVERRIDES
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** Uncomment these for development
***REMOVED*** DEBUG=true
***REMOVED*** LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG
***REMOVED*** JWT_SECRET=dev-secret-not-for-production

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** PRODUCTION SECURITY CHECKLIST
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** Before deploying to production, ensure:
***REMOVED*** 1. ENVIRONMENT=production
***REMOVED*** 2. DEBUG=false
***REMOVED*** 3. Strong JWT_SECRET (32+ random characters)
***REMOVED*** 4. Strong DATABASE_URL with secure credentials
***REMOVED*** 5. Restricted CORS_ORIGINS (no wildcards)
***REMOVED*** 6. Appropriate ALLOWED_HOSTS
***REMOVED*** 7. ENABLE_PERFORMANCE_METRICS=true (if monitoring is set up)
